{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom is Divided</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet unrest has left Myridor on the brink of divide. A movement to topple the king is set into motion with the kidnapping of his three children - and only you can fight to bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Forces</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy forces, build an army, and lead your faction alongside Luc and Alaric through turn-based tactical combat. The closer you grow to your companions, the greater your strength becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy close moments with the companions within your faction. With branching dialogue choices and an affection point system, you can choose who to keep closest to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Journey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With themes of mental health, power, and survival in mind, traverse Myridor's darkest days - and witness the narrative-focused journey come to light.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809160?t=1772914405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/04e44580b476eca50e8102c4c58f2f2938e884f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772914405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772914405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772914405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom is Divided</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet unrest has left Myridor on the brink of divide. A movement to topple the king is set into motion with the kidnapping of his three children - and only you can fight to bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Forces</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy forces, build an army, and lead your faction alongside Luc and Alaric through turn-based tactical combat. The closer you grow to your companions, the greater your strength becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy close moments with the companions within your faction. With branching dialogue choices and an affection point system, you can choose who to keep closest to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Journey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With themes of mental health, power, and survival in mind, traverse Myridor's darkest days - and witness the narrative-focused journey come to light.</p>","developers":["Amy Marie Elliott","Stella Noctis Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/a80bf617d09764b4d6e3dba8c0c1e5c1f2617e2b/header.jpg?t=1772914405","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3809160/127034946/c59b33a12aeb8cbf688b9a0e088c4e560338dbd9/1761957291/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772193966","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store